John Deere integrates IoT sensors, machine learning, and cloud dashboards (Operations Center and JDLink) to predict equipment failures before they occur, analyzing engine temperature, vibration, component wear across tractor and combine fleets. Predictive maintenance alerts farmers to schedule servicing proactively, reducing costly downtime and unnecessary part replacements. The ecosystem has generated over USD 1 billion in annual savings for John Deere and customers combined through optimized maintenance scheduling, extended equipment life, and fuel efficiency gains.